[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package contains the sources of the passenger module only.  It does
not install a loadable module.

The module itself is built by the nginx ports.  To use passenger, build
www/nginx, www/nginx-devel or www/freenginx with the PASSENGER option
enabled.

The module is only the connection to nginx.  The Passenger agent, which
runs the applications, comes from www/rubygem-passenger built with the
nginx flavor, and nginx has to be told where it lives:

    passenger_root %%PREFIX%%/lib/ruby/gems/<version>/gems/passenger-<version>;

The command "passenger-config --root" prints the path to use.
EOM
}
]
